<title>FRANCE: Rhone-Poulenc results' sector breakdown.</title>
<headline>Rhone-Poulenc results' sector breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Breakdown of sales and operating income divisions, in millions of francs.</p>
<p>THIRD QUARTER</p>
<p>SALES</p>
<p>    - Health		 9,785	   vs	9,045</p>
<p>    - Agro		   2,323	   vs	2,025</p>
<p>    - Chemicals	    5,896	   vs	5,906</p>
<p>    - Fibers &amp; Polymers  2,640	   vs	2,714</p>
<p>    - Others		   133	   vs	  128</p>
<p>OPERATING INCOME</p>
<p>    - Health		 1,583	   vs	  977</p>
<p>    - Agro		     237	   vs	  153</p>
<p>    - Chemicals		281	   vs	  278</p>
<p>    - Fibers &amp; Polymers    115	   vs	  248</p>
<p>    - Others loss	    162	   vs  loss  195</p>
<p>NINE MONTHS</p>
<p>SALES</p>
<p>    - Health		28,797	   vs     27,053</p>
<p>    - Agro		   8,686	   vs	8,077</p>
<p>    - Health		18,438	   vs     18,734</p>
<p>    - Fibers &amp; Polymers  8,407	   vs	9,153</p>
<p>    - Others		   491	   vs	  563</p>
<p>OPERATING INCOME</p>
<p>    - Health		 3,584	   vs	2,756</p>
<p>    - Agro		   1,388	   vs	1,158</p>
<p>    - Chemicals		908	   vs	  782</p>
<p>    - Fibres &amp; Polymers    366	   vs	  710</p>
<p>    - Others	 loss    558	   vs loss   531</p>
<p>NOTE - Rhone-Poulenc SA gave the figures in a statement.</p>
</text>
